  "fixes": [
    "Bookshelf opening uses saved chapter entries even when old detail metadata is unavailable.",
    "A completely missing catalogue triggers bounded same-book/author/chapter recovery, preserving shelf settings, same-chapter position, unique bookmark mappings, history and original cache files.",
